      "writtenOn": "2025-10-09T17:50:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi All! Apologies for delay in response, as I was on vacation. I have raised a cross bug for this - https://partnerissuetracker.corp.google.com/issues/450532992 . Meanwhile, As Bernardo has recieved request for individual command support for ptl and has  written another CL ( https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/7007087 ) related to this, I will realign this CL further to align with his CL. Thanks.",
      "revId": "d098d4061a40d7046d6594423cb0cd3f1520cc28",
